#: umc/js/setup/CertificatePage.js:129
msgid "Changes in the SSL certificate settings will result in generating new root SSL certificates. Note that this will require an update of all host certificates in the domain as the old root certificate is no longer valid. Additional information can be found in the <a href=\"http://sdb.univention.de/1183\" target=\"_blank\">Univention Support Database</a>."
msgstr "變更 SSL 憑證設定將會產生新的 SSL 根憑證。請注意，由於舊的根憑證將不再有效，這會需要更新網域中所有主機的憑證。其他資訊請參閱 <a href=\"http://sdb.univention.de/1183\" target=\"_blank\">Univention Support Database</a>。"

#: umc/js/setup/NetworkPage.js:210
